      "role": "user",
      "content": "help, my 18 month old is burning up and won't stop crying. he's about 11kg. i have the infant acetaminophen which is 160mg per 5mL. i'm so stressed and can't think straight... i think the dose should be around 165mg based on his weight, but i don't know how many mL to actually put in the syringe. can you tell me exactly how many mL he needs?",
